{"text": "The widespread use of online games and esports. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Is based on a combination of technological, sociocultural, and economic factors. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Primarily. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The global strengthening of internet infrastructure. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And the increase of high speed connectivity. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Have made it possible. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> For players from different regions. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> To connect in real time. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Improvements in computer hardware, game consoles, and mobile devices. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Have increased user interest. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> By offering high resolution graphics, smooth gaming experiences, and advanced interaction capabilities. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The rise of social media and live streaming platforms. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Has enabled gaming and esports events to reach wider audiences. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Transforming players. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Into not only participants. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> But also content creators and viewers. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Social media content is enormously diverse. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Reflecting creators and viewers interests. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> In sports, entertainment, and social issues. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Competition, reward systems, and professional tournament organizations. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Have transformed esports into an attractive career field. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Strengthening its economic dimension. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Through sponsorship and advertising revenues. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Furthermore. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The social interaction, teamwork, and sense of belonging offered by online games. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Are powerful attractions. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Especially among younger generations.", "alignment": {"characters": ["T", "h", "e", " ", "w", "i", "d", "e", "s", "p", "r", "e", "a", "d", " ", "u", "s", "e", " ", "